    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "我和大星去学校。大星今天要看很多书，学一些新东西。",
      "traditional": "我和大星去學校。大星今天要看很多書，學一些新東西。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ hé dà xīng qù xué xiào dà xīng jīn tiān yào kàn hěn duō shū xué yì xiē xīn dōng xi",
      "english": "I went to school with Daxing. Daxing needed to read lots of books today and learn some new things."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "他的女朋友去书店了，没有来学校。",
      "traditional": "他的女朋友去書店了，沒有來學校。",
      "pinyin": "tā de nǚ péng you qù shū diàn le méi yǒu lái xué xiào",
      "english": "His girlfriend went to the bookstore and did not come to school."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我今天没看见他的女朋友，也没看见茶茶手机。",
      "traditional": "我今天沒看見他的女朋友，也沒看見茶茶手機。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ jīn tiān méi kàn jiàn tā de nǚ péng you yě méi kàn jiàn chá chá shǒu jī",
      "english": "I didn’t see his girlfriend today, nor did I see the Chacha phone."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我想看见茶茶，我想知道他什么时候去我们家。",
      "traditional": "我想看見茶茶，我想知道他什麼時候去我們家。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng kàn jiàn chá chá wǒ xiǎng zhī dào tā shén me shí hou qù wǒ men jiā",
      "english": "I wanted to see Chacha. I wanted to know when he will come to our house."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我要怎么做？我要怎么做可以帮大星？",
      "traditional": "我要怎麼做？我要怎麼做可以幫大星？",
      "pinyin": "wǒ yào zěn me zuò wǒ yào zěn me zuò kě yǐ bāng dà xīng",
      "english": "What should I do? What should I do to help Daxing?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "星期一晚上八点，大星的女朋友来了，她来我们家了！",
      "traditional": "星期一晚上八點，大星的女朋友來了，她來我們家了！",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī yī wǎn shang bā diǎn dà xīng de nǚ péng you lái le tā lái wǒ men jiā le",
      "english": "On Monday at 8 pm, Daxing’s girlfriend came over. She came to our house!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "她来了，茶茶手机也来了！是今天吗？会是今天吗？",
      "traditional": "她來了，茶茶手機也來了！是今天嗎？會是今天嗎？",
