    "sentence_translations": [
      "(16) Chacha Is Here",
      "",
      "I went to school with Daxing. Daxing needed to read lots of books today and learn some new things.",
      "His girlfriend went to the bookstore and did not come to school.",
      "I didn’t see his girlfriend today, nor did I see the Chacha phone.",
      "",
      "I wanted to see Chacha. I wanted to know when he will come to our house.",
      "What should I do? What should I do to help Daxing?",
      "",
      "On Monday at 8 pm, Daxing’s girlfriend came over. She came to our house!",
      "She came, and the Chacha phone also came! Is it today? Will it be today?",
      "",
      "I said, “Chacha, you’re here.”",
      "",
      "Chacha looked at me and asked, “Xiaomi, you know?”",
      "",
      "I said, “Yes, I know. Can you … not do this?”"
